## 11. Task Accounting, Fleet Metrics & Verification Invariants

### 11.1 Conservation of Tasks Invariant
Let $\mathcal{S} = \{\text{Pending}, \text{Assigned}, \text{InProgress}, \text{Completed}, \text{Cancelled}, \text{Failed}\}$.
For all simulation epochs $t \in [0, T_{\text{final}}]$:
$$\sum_{S \in \mathcal{S}} |\mathcal{T}_S(t)| = N_{\text{total}}$$
Zero tasks may be duplicated, orphaned, or leaked across states.

### 11.2 Fleet Throughput & Makespan
- **Fleet Mission Makespan**:
  $$T_{\text{make}} = \max_{j \in \mathcal{T}_{\text{completed}}} t_{\text{completion}}(j) - \min_{j \in \mathcal{T}} t_{\text{injection}}(j)$$
- **Average Mission Throughput**:
  $$\Theta = \frac{|\mathcal{T}_{\text{completed}}|}{T_{\text{horizon}}} \quad \left[\frac{\text{tasks}}{\text{second}}\right]$$
- **Service Level / Deadline Compliance (SLC)**:
  $$\text{SLC} = \frac{1}{|\mathcal{T}_{\text{completed}}|} \sum_{j \in \mathcal{T}_{\text{completed}}} \mathbb{I}\Big( t_{\text{completion}}(j) \le D_j \Big)$$

### 11.3 Safety Metric Verification Invariants
During any valid benchmark execution:
1. **Zero Physical Collisions**:
   $$\sum_{k=1}^K \mathbb{I}_{\text{Gazebo\_Contact_Sensor}} = 0$$
2. **Zero Chassis Overlap Violations**:
   $$\forall i \ne j, \quad \min_t \|\mathbf{x}_i(t) - \mathbf{x}_j(t)\|_2 \ge 2 \cdot r_{\text{robot}} = 0.60\,\text{m}$$
3. **Zero Unrecovered Deadlocks**:
   $$\forall \text{cycle } \mathcal{C}, \quad t_{\text{recovery}}(\mathcal{C}) \le T_{\text{deadlock\_max}} = 10.0\,\text{s}$$

